Package: alforge
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), sudo, apt-utils, dpkg
Recommends: systemd, curl, ca-certificates
Description: Multi-forge CLI to install and keep .deb packages up to date
 alforge is a clean, multi-forge CLI tool that installs and automatically keeps
 .deb packages from GitHub, GitLab, Codeberg, and Gitea/Forgejo up to date.
 It features architecture-aware asset selection, SHA-256 checksum verification,
 per-user XDG-compliant configuration, and set-and-forget updates via
 systemd --user timers. Root privileges are only required for apt-get operations.